  admin1 --> SAFR001 : Manage AI's compliance and parameter settings

  SysAdmin -> (admin1) : System Administrator actions on system components

  client1 <-- SFR002 : Receive personalized recommendations
  client1 <|-- AIFR002 : Client receives recommendations from AI

  advisor1 --> FAFR003 : View predictive analytics for clients' financial situations, which are generated by the system (SFR)
  
  Sys -> (SFR) : System requests and generates services
  
  SFR008 <|-- AIFR006 : Anomaly detection alerts from AI
